WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.560
Odin, Your Excellency,

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.880
Lieutenant Shigrud Heiza's progress report has been arranged.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:12.880
I'm concerned about whether we should begin
the final phase of the Midgard plan.

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.370
Midgard...

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.760
The human world?

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:19.460
This is work for gods.

00:00:19.970 --> 00:00:22.980
Don't you think so, Captain Hendal?

00:00:23.150 --> 00:00:24.420
As you say.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.040
Which means that we are creating a new world, aren't we.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:33.440
Foolishness. It's impossible for humans to become gods.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.940
What we are doing is just gene manipulation.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:40.740
If you forget that, there'll be serious consequences.

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.330
There's no time left, Professor Rocky.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:47.100
We need to get the result this time,

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:50.460
but it seems like something's wrong.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:55.310
What a pity... Klein's not here at a time like this...

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:58.170
Miserable things have been done to his children as well.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.640
However, this is all for the sake of humanity.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.140
In 24 hours, at Dagger Pagoda:

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:32.180
come alone and I'll tell you.

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:34.800
<i>This might be a trap.</i>

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.720
<i>But... Zagi knows something.</i>

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:38.840
Thor!

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.140
Thor, you put on the Toriki Oil, right?

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.420
Tiz...

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:48.050
People from Chimera have good ears.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:51.190
Everything that guy whispered to you, I heard it all.

00:02:51.890 --> 00:02:53.690
Let's go see Blanc Wolf right away.

00:02:54.330 --> 00:02:56.610
Oi... I'm going alone.

00:02:56.900 --> 00:02:59.990
In a boss battle you'll need a witness
who holds a position higher than Third.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.160
You know this, don't you?

00:03:05.150 --> 00:03:07.790
If I don't come back, run away and find Third.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.460
Zagi won't go easy on women either.

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.960
Because that guy's an outsider.

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:16.550
People from outside don't understand
how important our rules are.

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:21.880
I see it  - Dagger Pagoda.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.560
It's the first time I've seen it this close.

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:26.600
We're landing.

00:03:42.260 --> 00:03:45.610
Yo. I told you to come alone.

00:03:46.240 --> 00:03:48.100
How could I allow Top to come by himself?

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:50.870
Tiz. Wait here.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:53.900
Zagi, let's talk, just the two of us.

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:04.050
Thor.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.180
Do you really want to become Jyu Oh?

00:04:10.680 --> 00:04:11.640
What do you want to say?

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.810
Becoming Jyu Oh and returning to the Colony;

00:04:15.260 --> 00:04:17.230
there's no point.

00:04:17.410 --> 00:04:18.070
No point?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:23.320
In the past I bombed an opposing faction
and was sent to Hecate.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.320
My penalty was life imprisonment.

00:04:26.910 --> 00:04:30.620
I should have been imprisoned in Hecate for the rest of my life.

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.960
Then why were you sent to Chimera?

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:37.880
Because I saw... I saw something I shouldn't have seen.

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:42.670
Hecate is a prison planet,

00:04:43.070 --> 00:04:45.970
but it has a huge research facility called <i>"Ion II".</i>

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:51.050
As a boy in juvenile detention,

00:04:51.430 --> 00:04:54.390
it took me a year of planning to sneak in there.

00:04:54.860 --> 00:04:55.640
Why?

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:57.480
Because I was bored.

00:05:00.940 --> 00:05:02.070
I saw it there.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:09.160
Tens of generations of Jyu Oh were frozen there.

00:05:10.770 --> 00:05:11.700
Don't tell me...

00:05:12.140 --> 00:05:15.710
Jyu Oh never existed from the beginning.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.840
It's just bait to get the beasts to kill each other.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:20.960
You're lying!

00:05:21.690 --> 00:05:23.630
The fact that I'm here is the evidence.

00:05:24.220 --> 00:05:28.430
The moment you become Jyu Oh is
the moment of your life comes to an end.

00:05:29.210 --> 00:05:30.000
You're lying!

00:05:30.570 --> 00:05:33.640
Going to all this effort to overthrow
your rivals won't mean anything.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:35.350
You're lying!

00:05:37.780 --> 00:05:39.980
It's a lie... that's...

00:05:41.010 --> 00:05:42.530
If Jyu Oh is just a phantom,

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:45.650
What have I been fighting for up until now?

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:47.840
That's right...

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:51.520
If Jyu Oh doesn't exist, Rings have no meaning either.

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:54.080
Although this is a lawless planet used for punishment by death,

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.120
people have been strictly controlled with rules.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:01.670
Become Jyu Oh if you want. I'll help you,

00:06:02.150 --> 00:06:04.670
and create a new world here...

00:06:05.290 --> 00:06:07.370
you.. and I..

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:08.740
Nonsense.

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:13.220
If the Rings collapse,
the army will definitely intervene and suppress us.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:16.890
Even you won't get involved in a war you'll definitely lose.

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:23.610
You are aiming to negotiate with Juno
in exchange for your information, right?

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:34.990
I knew it, Thor.

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:40.580
You're the only human being who I can talk with on equal terms.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:44.250
Listen, my real aim is...

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:48.300
Who's there? Show yourself!

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.030
Tiz.

00:06:52.490 --> 00:06:55.370
Eavesdropping? Just like the wild children, huh.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.620
Sorry, Thor.

00:06:56.920 --> 00:06:59.000
I couldn't just stay there...

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:03.440
That's why I told you to come by yourself.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.490
Don't do anything to Tiz.

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.610
If she's killed, I won't forgive even you.

00:07:09.220 --> 00:07:09.950
Thor...

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.780
Let me tell you,

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:14.680
your Top will become Jyu Oh:

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:18.000
king of the only kingdom in Chimera.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:19.660
What's this about?

00:07:22.750 --> 00:07:26.420
The wind is starting up. A blizzard will start soon.

00:07:27.320 --> 00:07:28.920
Come to Night Ring's stronghold.

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:30.220
Night Ring?

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:32.430
It's my stronghold now.

00:07:32.870 --> 00:07:34.180
We'll talk there.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:39.930
Don't go, Thor. This is a trap!

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:44.860
Tiz, I still have something to ask Zagi.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:47.270
Zagi doesn't intend to kill me just yet.

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:49.070
We're only going to talk.

00:07:54.870 --> 00:07:56.960
Thor, you're being weird!

00:07:57.470 --> 00:07:59.460
Why are you obeying Zagi like this?!

00:07:59.960 --> 00:08:02.020
What do you expect to hear from him?!!

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.280
Thor! Don't go that way!

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:11.140
Blanc Wolf! Die!!!

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:12.850
Zagi!

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:18.780
Stop! That's Ochre's Top!

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:19.620
What?

00:08:48.490 --> 00:08:49.210
Second!

00:08:50.450 --> 00:08:51.550
Kill them.

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.050
Second?

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:57.970
Thor, why did you protect me?

00:08:59.070 --> 00:08:59.890
<i>"Why"?</i>

00:09:01.690 --> 00:09:03.430
You really are an idiot.

00:09:04.880 --> 00:09:08.270
I didn't protect you. I just wanted both of us to escape.

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:11.760
That's why you are an idiot.

00:09:12.050 --> 00:09:12.660
Top?

00:09:14.350 --> 00:09:16.070
Top, are you injured?

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:19.660
I told you not to follow me, Karin.

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.640
But there are still remnants from Night Ring around here.

00:09:25.590 --> 00:09:26.260
What is it?

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:27.420
Nothing...

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:30.460
Well, your Second's like this too, isn't she?

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:33.380
Karin's really a woman.

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:35.840
<i>A woman...</i>

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:38.970
<i>and she has Ochre's skin colour.</i>

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.330
<i>How beautiful she is.</i>

00:09:57.140 --> 00:10:00.210
<i>There's no woman like her among Ochre Ring's females.</i>

00:10:01.370 --> 00:10:02.880
<i>Even in the Colony...</i>

00:10:03.500 --> 00:10:04.060
Thor!

00:10:05.210 --> 00:10:07.040
According to the order, it's my turn first.

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.630
The order of having children is already arranged.

00:10:11.240 --> 00:10:13.720
I won't allow you to go against the order.

00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:29.570
Night Ring's stronghold. It's the first time I've come here.

00:10:31.180 --> 00:10:33.700
Criminal pods often land in this area.

00:10:34.140 --> 00:10:36.240
It seems they build the Ring using the wreckage.

00:10:40.900 --> 00:10:42.120
Are you ok, Tiz?

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:45.310
Sorry, something tripped me...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:50.470
What?

00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:52.830
It's not that rare to see a corpse, is it?

00:10:53.670 --> 00:10:57.040
Those people were planning to attack Blanc Ring
as soon as the Day cycle starts.

00:10:57.470 --> 00:10:59.640
<i>"It'll be easy when the Day cycle comes."</i>

00:11:00.060 --> 00:11:02.140
Those guys killed themselves with that kind of thinking.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:06.900
Karin, take Ochre Ring's Second to B block.

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:08.650
I want to be with Thor.

00:11:09.140 --> 00:11:11.150
Don't worry; I'll send for you later.

00:11:11.880 --> 00:11:13.650
Thor, let's talk.

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.240
Right.

00:11:25.020 --> 00:11:28.130
Drink. It's juice with sake mixed in.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:29.420
It'll warm you up.

00:11:30.740 --> 00:11:31.380
Zagi...

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:35.140
When did you join Blanc Ring?

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:37.300
Not long after you disappeared.

00:11:37.850 --> 00:11:39.260
The timing was right.

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:42.890
Why didn't you tell me to join Blanc Ring?

00:11:45.160 --> 00:11:47.250
I wanted to watch you.

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.270
What you would do, whether you would manage to survive.

00:11:51.050 --> 00:11:53.040
And you did survive.

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:59.550
More than that, you became Ochre Ring's Top.
You've grown to be well known,

00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:01.540
as I predicted.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:03.950
No, better then I predicted.

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:08.710
This is your room.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.160
Wait here for the time being.

00:12:11.670 --> 00:12:13.590
Are you going back to Top's room?

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:14.660
That's cunning!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:15.670
Cunning?

00:12:15.850 --> 00:12:17.630
We are both Seconds, right?

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:20.010
If you're going back, I should too...

00:12:20.400 --> 00:12:21.540
What are you talking about?

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:24.190
This is our territory.

00:12:24.360 --> 00:12:26.430
I have the right to protect Thor!

00:12:26.990 --> 00:12:28.140
Thor is my Top,

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:30.640
and next Kou no Tsuki, he'll become my husband.

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:32.890
You want to have Zagi's child too, don't you?

00:12:33.270 --> 00:12:34.880
I won't give birth to any children.

00:12:36.170 --> 00:12:39.280
If I have a child I'll have to leave Zagi.

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:40.790
Therefore I won't.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:46.260
Not wanting to bear the child of the strong man
in front of you? That's pretty weird!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:48.780
In Blanc Ring there's no Kou no Tsuki.

00:12:49.610 --> 00:12:51.810
Zagi decided it when he became our Top.

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:55.900
He killed Blanc Ring's female Top who opposed it.

00:12:56.470 --> 00:12:58.390
Killed... a woman?

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:02.040
Zagi is absolute.
Whether you're a man or a woman has nothing to do with it.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:04.980
I'll come for you if it's permitted.

00:13:08.520 --> 00:13:10.220
<i>These people are definitely weird.</i>

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:12.780
<i>It's no good, Thor.</i>

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.240
If you listen to what these people say...

00:13:16.600 --> 00:13:18.110
Chimera's independence?

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:22.030
Impossible. Odin won't agree to such a demand.

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:23.760
No, he'll agree.

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:28.190
If you want the reason, this planet is necessary to him.

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:29.330
Necessary?

00:13:30.100 --> 00:13:31.290
Think about it.

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:36.020
If this planet were simply designated for capital punishment
why would he need to hide it's existence?

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:39.340
They want to do something using Chimera.

00:13:40.410 --> 00:13:42.020
I'm not sure what they want to do though.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:44.810
What do you want me to do?

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:49.560
A war for independence needs a person with charisma.

00:13:50.070 --> 00:13:50.970
Charisma?

00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:52.830
It suits you;

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:55.270
beautiful, powerful;

00:13:55.690 --> 00:13:59.300
someone who's bearing the tragedy of being
abandoned to this hell by the federation.

00:13:59.470 --> 00:14:01.550
Are you telling me to play a farce?

00:14:02.420 --> 00:14:05.490
Stop kidding around! Be the charismatic man yourself.

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:08.600
Then, you want to kill me and become Jyu Oh

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.390
in order to get yourself frozen?

00:14:10.770 --> 00:14:12.810
It's up to you, Thor.

00:14:13.310 --> 00:14:15.170
You don't have any other choices, do you?

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:21.900
Top, sorry to interrupt.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:24.710
Ochre's Second is very uneasy.

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:25.760
Tiz?

00:14:26.330 --> 00:14:28.530
Zagi, let's talk about this later.

00:14:28.990 --> 00:14:29.720
That's fine.

00:14:34.500 --> 00:14:37.870
Go out and turn left. It's the fifth building.

00:14:38.550 --> 00:14:39.240
Thank you.

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:48.710
Second's uneasy, huh?

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:54.100
Top.

00:15:01.900 --> 00:15:02.620
Listen...

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:06.550
Please listen, Top, that guy is...

00:15:07.060 --> 00:15:07.720
Quiet.

00:15:08.410 --> 00:15:10.320
Zagi... Listen, please!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:11.300
Be quiet!

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:16.700
Please, even if you kill me, listen!

00:15:17.010 --> 00:15:19.370
He can't be the one, only that guy can't...

00:15:19.740 --> 00:15:20.920
That guy is poisonous.

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:23.850
He will kill you one day.

00:15:24.140 --> 00:15:25.740
Please, just that guy...

00:15:26.230 --> 00:15:27.990
Please give up with that guy!

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:30.490
Is this all you have to say?!

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:31.790
Stop it!

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:34.230
Thor.

00:15:35.160 --> 00:15:36.250
That's enough, Zagi.

00:15:37.270 --> 00:15:39.080
Although she's Second, she's also a woman.

00:15:41.970 --> 00:15:44.680
I don't think Ochre Ring's Top should say that.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:48.100
<i>"You can never disobey Top's command".</i>

00:15:48.720 --> 00:15:51.080
This is the only rule in Blanc Ring -

00:15:51.360 --> 00:15:52.590
it's my rule.

00:15:52.870 --> 00:15:54.810
Anyone who breaks this rule is no longer useful.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:58.430
Karin, leave right now.

00:15:58.890 --> 00:15:59.530
Zagi...

00:16:02.450 --> 00:16:05.160
Thor, you should go to your Second.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:13.680
Why did you disobey Zagi?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:17.540
You knew it was going to be like this, didn't you?

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:19.620
I was prepared.

00:16:20.300 --> 00:16:23.170
I want Zagi to know that you're very dangerous.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:24.880
Why?

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:26.420
I haven't done anything.

00:16:27.220 --> 00:16:30.680
Zagi can't make any special exceptions.

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:34.460
Everyone follows him because he is absolute!

00:16:34.830 --> 00:16:36.150
If this collapses...

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.390
Don't think Zagi will fall that easily.

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.260
He'll leave me when he's finished using me, right?

00:16:45.380 --> 00:16:47.910
You don't understand! Neither you nor Zagi!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.540
You are a man loved by a goddess,

00:16:50.930 --> 00:16:53.160
that's why no one can kill you.

00:16:53.880 --> 00:16:56.360
Zagi must be the one who's going to be killed.

00:16:57.300 --> 00:16:58.000
Karin...

00:17:00.060 --> 00:17:01.000
Don't touch me!

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.130
Don't be so quick to leave, Karin!

00:17:05.840 --> 00:17:09.180
Before this blizzard ends, I'll convince Zagi to change his mind.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:10.760
Stay out of other's business!

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:23.970
Thor!

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.570
Thor, I was worried.

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.450
Hey Thor, let's leave this place.

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:35.740
What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:17:36.710 --> 00:17:37.320
No...

00:17:38.830 --> 00:17:41.410
Thor, what did Zagi tell you?

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:51.950
What Zagi said is reliable.

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:54.760
<i>"I'll definitely leave Jyu Oh Sei one day;</i>

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.590
<i>go to Hecate and return to Juno where Odin is."</i>

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:02.400
My goal has disappeared like a phantom.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.810
Now, the only thing I can do is help
Zagi with his independence war.

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:07.610
You're wrong!

00:18:09.750 --> 00:18:10.430
Tiz...

00:18:10.820 --> 00:18:14.720
Thor, I... I know I don't really understand complicated things,

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:19.720
but that guy... Zagi definitely won't do anything for your sake!

00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.950
I don't have much time left.

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:26.590
If everything goes smoothly, we can lure Odin to this planet,

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:27.760
and then...

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:31.930
Thor,

00:18:32.830 --> 00:18:34.390
I'll give the birth to your child.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:37.350
Your descendants will be here,

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:40.330
so there's nothing to be scared of, right?

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:44.610
Tiz,

00:18:46.610 --> 00:18:48.110
you really are a good person.

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:52.010
Thor...

00:18:54.810 --> 00:18:56.540
<i>Thank you, Tiz.</i>

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:59.130
<i>I want to be with you always,</i>

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:03.390
<i>but I can't think about having a child with you.</i>

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:07.700
<i>Still, you are important to me.</i>

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.960
<i>These feelings... my feelings for you are true.</i>

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:19.510
We really can't find her anywhere!

00:19:19.520 --> 00:19:20.940
That's impossible!

00:19:21.140 --> 00:19:22.810
She can't go anywhere in this blizzard.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:24.190
Search for her more thoroughly!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:27.360
If we stay outside like this any longer we'll be killed.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:30.820
What is it? What's going on?

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:33.730
Our Second left!

00:19:34.160 --> 00:19:36.910
She won't be able to hold out for more
than 30 minutes in this blizzard.

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:38.490
Karin?...

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.910
Tiz, you wait here.

00:19:43.850 --> 00:19:44.580
Thor!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.170
Thor, wait! I'm going too!

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:48.290
You want to die?!

00:19:48.600 --> 00:19:49.670
Let go of me!

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.550
Thor! Thor!!!

00:19:56.360 --> 00:20:00.100
Karin!

00:20:06.980 --> 00:20:08.510
<i>Even if I find her, what can I do?</i>

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:12.740
<i>I'm the reason she left, aren't I?</i>

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:21.930
Karin!

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:28.330
Oi, Karin, pull yourself together!

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:29.100
Karin!

00:20:31.130 --> 00:20:31.990
You?...

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:33.470
Go back to the stronghold.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:35.680
You'll die if you stay here.

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:38.850
Even if I go back I'll be killed.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.020
Zagi has abandoned me.

00:20:41.400 --> 00:20:43.310
I'll talk to Zagi about it.

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.450
Zagi will never change his command.

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:49.280
You don't know Zagi!

00:20:49.670 --> 00:20:51.640
I don't want you to die!

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:52.620
Don't touch me!

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:57.660
Karin!
